  "prefLabel": "Ed 801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 801.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to ensure uniform application of RSA 194-F in the establishment and administration of the education freedom accounts (EFA) program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 800) #13345, eff 2-22-22",
